    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d436">

                <pb facs="0905" n="819" sameAs="frus:frus1941-43/pg819"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">Hopkins Papers</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Assistant Secretary, War Department General
                        Staff</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">McCarthy</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the President’s Special Assistant</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Hopkins</hi>)<anchor n="1" xml:id="d436-f1"/></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Casablanca</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1943-01-19">January 19, 1943</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>I believe you already have this information, but I pass it along to make
                    sure.</p>
                <quote rend="blockquote">
                    <p>“Harrison, our ambassador in Switzerland, states that LeBrun is now at this
                        home at Chateau de Hixelle near Grenoble, which is southeast of Lyon.
                        Indications are that his health is good, but he is under constant
                        surveillance. He was in Switzerland early in November.”</p>
                </quote>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">McCarthy</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
